*** T03-check-real — rational-linear-arithmetic SMT checks lifted from the reference suite (Misc/smtTest.maude)
set show timing off .
load smt

fmod TEST-R is
  pr REAL .
  vars W X Y Z : Boolean .
  vars P Q R S : Real .
endfm

check P > Q and Q > R .
check P > Q and Q > R and R > P .
check P < Q and Q < R .
check P < Q and Q < R and R < P .
check P >= Q and Q >= P .
check P >= Q and Q >= P and P =/== Q .
check P <= Q and Q <= P .
check P <= Q and Q <= P and P =/== Q .

check P === Q + R and P > Q and P > R .
check P === Q + R and P > Q + R .
check P === Q + R and P > Q + R + S .
check P === Q - R and P > Q + R .
check - P === Q - R and P > Q + R .
check P =/== Q + R and P > Q + R .
check (P > Q ? P : Q) >= P and (P > Q ? P : Q) >= Q .
check (P > Q ? P : Q) < P .
check (P > Q ? P : Q) === P or (P > Q ? P : Q) === Q .
check not((P > Q ? P : Q) === P or (P > Q ? P : Q) === Q) .
check (P > Q ? P : Q) =/== P and (P > Q ? P : Q) =/== Q .
